.TH GPUBENCH 1 "September 2026" "GPUBench 1.4.6" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gpubench \- Modern cross-backend GPU compute and hardware ray tracing benchmark
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gpubench
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B GPUBench
is a high-performance cross-backend GPU compute and ray tracing benchmarking utility supporting Vulkan 1.4, AMD ROCm/HIP, and OpenCL. It evaluates raw compute capabilities (FP64, FP32, FP16, BF16, FP8, INT8), VRAM and cache bandwidth, hardware-accelerated BVH traversal, and dynamic wavefront ray scheduling (Work Lists / DGC).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Display program version information and exit.
.TP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-benchmarks\fR \fIBENCHMARKS\fR
Comma-separated list of benchmarks to run (e.g., fp32,fp64,mem_bandwidth,ray_scheduling).
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-groups\fR \fIGROUPS\fR
Benchmark groups to run: compute, memory, graphics (combines raster & raytracing), raster, raytracing, system, or all.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-benchmarks\fR
List all available benchmarks organized by group.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-groups\fR
List available benchmark groups.
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-device\fR \fIINDEX\fR
Specify target GPU device index (e.g., 0, 1).
.TP
\fB\-l\fR, \fB\-\-list\-devices\fR
List all detected GPU compute devices across backends.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-backends\fR
List available compute backends.
.TP
\fB\-k\fR, \fB\-\-backend\fR \fIBACKEND\fR
Specify compute backend: auto, vulkan, opencl, rocm (default: auto).
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-scene\fR \fISCENE\fR
Ray tracing scenario: showroom, indoor, outdoor, all (default: indoor).
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-resolution\fR \fIRESPRESET\fR
Resolution preset: auto, 720p, 1080p, 1440p, 4k, 1024x1024, or custom WxH.
.TP
\fB\-\-bounces\fR \fIBOUNCES\fR
Number of light bounces for multi-bounce path tracing (1..8, default: 2).
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fIFORMAT\fR
Machine-readable output format: json or csv.
.TP
\fB\-\-output\-file\fR \fIFILE\fR
Write machine-readable output to this file instead of stdout.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gpubench-gui (1)
